C:\WORK\0.穈𨰰𥘵\PROMPT\prompt-stack\v32\codex\skills\design-analysis\SKILL.md:221:- route-quality scorecard when the real question is whether the chosen path, prioritization, or exploration depth was actually good
C:\WORK\0.穈𨰰𥘵\PROMPT\prompt-stack\v32\codex\skills\design-analysis\SKILL.md:222:- benchmark registry memo when design candidates must be compared against an explicit replay or evaluation surface
