C:\WORK\0.穈𨰰𥘵\PROMPT\prompt-stack\v32\codex\skills\design-analysis\SKILL.md:228:- if a resource memo is used for concurrency-heavy options, preserve `parallelism cap`, `join cost`, or `saturation risk` explicitly rather than collapsing them into a generic cost note
